      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The best energy weapon in the tree. Hold the trigger and it fires a continuous beam that does heavy damage every tick and ignores armor. It has no reload. When the charge is gone, it is gone.\n\nIt is an Assembly Line recipe, researched from the Alien Blaster. The inputs are a Rad Emitter, a Nuclear Power Cell, a Carbon Receiver and Gunstock, a LuV field generator, two ZPM circuits, four lead plates, four Naquadah alloy plates and eight screws, with 1,152 mB of soldering alloy and 500 mB of lubricant. NEI has the exact list.\n\nIt is a tier 7 electric item holding 10 billion EU, and a beam tick costs 20 million EU. Charge it only in a ZPM charger or battery buffer; a lower one will not accept it.\n\n[note]The lead in the recipe is the shielding. Keep a spare Alien Blaster before you start, or the scan has nothing to read.[/note]",
